## 🏗️ Architecture

**Seating Engine**
- SeatingConstraint interface with NoSameClassAdjacentConstraint as the current rule
- New rules can be added as standalone classes with zero changes to the core algorithm — pure Strategy pattern, Open/Closed Principle in practice
- Backtracking allocator builds an empty seat grid per hall, then places students one at a time, checking every active constraint before committing

**Invigilator Assignment**
- Round-robin distribution across halls, cycling back through the invigilator list if halls outnumber staff

**Real-time Layer**
- Spring WebSocket + STOMP broadcasts on /topic/alerts
- Marking a student absent frees the seat in the database and pushes a live update to every connected client instantly — no polling

**API Layer**
- Spring Boot REST controllers: /api/admin/* for setup, /api/seating/* for generation, lookup, and assignment
- Global exception handler returns clean, readable error messages instead of generic server errors

## 🚀 Run Locally

**Prerequisites**
- Java 21+
- Node.js 18+
- MySQL or PostgreSQL

**Backend**
cd backend
./mvnw spring-boot:run
Runs on http://localhost:8080

**Frontend**
cd frontend
npm install
npm run dev
Open http://localhost:5173 🎉

Admin password: ADMIN

