## 🎤 Key Learnings

- Implemented a real constraint-satisfaction algorithm (backtracking) instead of basic CRUD logic
- Applied the Strategy design pattern to keep seating rules pluggable and testable independently
- Built and debugged a full WebSocket/STOMP real-time messaging layer from scratch
- Migrated from local MySQL to a cloud PostgreSQL instance for deployment without touching business logic — thanks to JPA's database-agnostic design
- Deployed a full-stack Java + React app end-to-end using Docker on Render and Vercel, with GitHub as the CI trigger

